			"size": [
				720.0,
				340.0
			],
			"text": "Cook opt 04 — component expressions, ParameterCHOP, TimeMachine\n\nWindow title: \"04 parameters\". Left to right, top row then bottom.\n\n1 ConstantTOP. Only the red component is the expression 0.5+0.5*sin(time). The color PULSES. Green and blue stay put. If this stays a flat dull blue, component expressions are not cooking.\n2 Circle radius expression. The orange circle BREATHES. A frozen circle means time expressions are not cooking.\n3 ParameterCHOP reading noise_live time_offset (sin(time)), trailed. The trace OSCILLATES.\n4 ParameterCHOP reading noise_still scale (4), trailed. A FLAT line near the middle. It must not wander.\n5 Still noise, time_offset 1. STILL.\n6 TimeMachine in Position mode on that still noise. The SAME still picture as cell 5. Not black.\n7 Noise with time_offset = sin(time). The pattern MOVES.\n8 TimeMachine in Speed mode at speed 1 on that live noise. The picture KEEPS CHANGING. It can lag cell 7. A freeze here means playback stopped.\n\nFail if the pulse or the breathing circle is frozen, cell 3 is flat while cell 7 moves, cell 6 is black, or cell 8 never changes.",
			"type": "note"
		}
	],
